{% set local_problem %}
<p>Albertville's trees keep gutters busy. Pine needles pile up throughout the year. Oak and maple leaves blanket everything in fall. Without regular cleaning, gutters clog, overflow, and send water exactly where you don't want it — against your foundation and siding.</p>

<p>Clogged gutters cause real damage. Foundation problems from water pooling around your house. Fascia rot from water backing up behind gutters. Landscape erosion from overflow. These repairs cost a lot more than gutter cleaning.</p>

<p>A lot of folks try to clean their own gutters. It's not fun work — climbing ladders, scooping out wet leaves, hoping you don't miss a clog. Our professional service is faster, more thorough, and a lot safer.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We do the job right. We hand-clean all debris from inside your gutters — not just blow it onto your lawn. We flush every downspout to make sure there are no hidden clogs. And we check your whole gutter system for problems while we're up there.</p>

<p>If we find loose hangers, small leaks, or other issues, we'll tell you. We can fix minor stuff on the spot or give you an estimate for bigger repairs. No surprise bills — you know what you're getting before we do anything.</p>

<p>When we leave, your gutters are clean, your downspouts are flowing, and your property is cleaned up. That's the job.</p>
{% endset %}

